.TH "tangsible-inventory" "1" "2026-10-15" "Tangsible" "Tangsible Manual"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
tangsible-inventory - browse the whole inventory as a tree
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBtangsible inventory\fR [\fIplaybook.\&yml\fR] [\fIansible-playbook args\fR .\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBinventory\fR shows an interactive tree of the whole inventory, similar to
\fBansible-inventory --graph\fR.\& Opening a host shows the same five-tab detail view
\fBtangsible-host\fR(1) shows.\& If \fIplaybook.\&yml\fR is omitted, it is resolved the same
way as \fBtangsible-run\fR(1) (see \fBtangsible\fR(1)), though a playbook is only
strictly required for the detail view'\&s own Plays tab.\&
.PP
Standard \fBansible-playbook\fR(1) arguments can be used, e.\&g.\& \fB--inventory\fR or
\fB--tags\fR can be provided.\&
.PP
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.PP
\fBUp/Down, Page Up/Down, CTRL-B/F, Home/End, CTRL-A/E\fR
.RS 4
Move the selection in the tree.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBEnter\fR
.RS 4
Toggle a group, or open the selected host'\&s detail view.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBRight\fR
.RS 4
Expand a collapsed group.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBLeft\fR
.RS 4
Collapse an expanded group - or, if it'\&s already collapsed, move
up to its parent group.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBE / C\fR
.RS 4
Expand / collapse every group.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBEsc\fR
.RS 4
From the detail view, clears an active search if there is one;
otherwise goes back to the tree.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBTab / Shift-Tab\fR
.RS 4
Switch tabs.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB/\fR
.RS 4
Search the active tab'\&s text.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBy\fR
.RS 4
Copy the active tab'\&s content to the clipboard.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBn / N\fR
.RS 4
Jump to the next / previous host, or the next / previous search match if
a search is active.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBq / Ctrl-C\fR
.RS 4
Quit.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
\fB0\fR
.RS 4
Normal exit, however the view was closed.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB1\fR
.RS 4
The inventory couldn'\&t be listed, it reported no hosts at all, or
unable to write the stub playbook to create the Plays tab.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBtangsible\fR(1), \fBtangsible-host\fR(1), \fBtangsible-hosts\fR(1)
